    {
      "source": "An <a href=\"../EnvironmentPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>EnvironmentPostProcessor</code></a> that parses JSON from\n<code>spring.application.json</code> or equivalently <code>SPRING_APPLICATION_JSON</code> and\nadds it as a map property source to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个 <a href=\"../EnvironmentPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>EnvironmentPostProcessor</code></a>，用于解析来自<code>spring.application.json</code>或等效的<code>SPRING_APPLICATION_JSON</code>的 JSON，并将其作为 Map 属性源添加到<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>中。",
